'''Attack on D-Cyclone (Expert)''' is the 2nd [[:Category:Cyclone Stages|Cyclone Stage]]. It was added in [[Version 2.2 Update#Version 2.2.3 Update|Version 2.2.3]] and appears every Wednesday. Upon completion, players have a 40% chance to unlock [[Bronze Cat (Rare Cat)|Bronze Cat]].

